{"n":"Candace","r":[0.0815,0.5985,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Arlecchino","r":[0.1259,0.5985,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1704,0.5985,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.2148,0.5985,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Candace","r":[0.0815,0.6593,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Skirk","r":[0.1259,0.6593,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1704,0.6593,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Escoffier","r":[0.2148,0.6593,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/candace/261111-224807/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Engulfing Lightning","text":"Generates teamwide particles on CRIT and helps meet her demanding Burst Energy needs. Needs CRIT Rate and an on-field CRIT hit."},{"name":"Favonius Lance","text":"Very high ER helps sustain her Burst."},{"name":"Rightful Reward","text":"HP% supports Candace’s buff."},{"name":"Kitain Cross Spear","text":"Energy restoration and EM help her Bloom setup, especially with refinements. Best for Bloom-focused builds or when the Skill passive fits rotations. R5 improves Energy refund."},{"name":"Dragon's Bane","text":"Large EM stat boosts Bloom damage when Candace herself triggers Dendro Cores. Bloom variation only; not a general HP/ER support weapon."},{"name":"Prototype Starglitter","text":"Craftable Energy Recharge stat stick that supports consistent Bursts. Normal/Charged Attack passive rarely matters off-field."},{"name":"Black Tassel","text":"Large HP% stat increases Candace’s HP-based Normal Attack buff. Only after meeting Energy Recharge needs from artifacts and team."}],"a":[{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst activation grants the party ATK.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · HP%/CR"},{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Provides reaction-based Elemental DMG buffs.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · HP%/CR"},{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"Increases ER and Burst DMG.","stats":"ER · HP% · HP%/CR"}],"t":[{"name":"Bloom Oasis","members":["Candace","Nilou","Yaoyao","Traveler (Dendro)"],"text":"Candace infuses Yaoyao or Dendro Traveler with Hydro to create Bountiful Cores. Give Bloom trigger characters EM; C6 adds Hydro waves.","roles":["Hydro Enabler / Buffer","Bloom Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Healer / Dendro Enabler","Dendro Enabler / Battery"]},{"name":"Hyperbloom Guard","members":["Candace","Kuki Shinobu","Nahida","Fischl"],"text":"Candace grants Kuki Hydro-infused attacks to make Cores, while Kuki triggers Hyperbloom. Nahida supplies Dendro; Fischl adds damage.","roles":["Hydro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Reaction Trigger","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]},{"name":"Crimson Tide","members":["Candace","Arlecchino","Bennett","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"C6 Candace supplies AoE Hydro waves for Arlecchino Vaporize; Bennett buffs and Kazuha groups and reduces resistance. Requires C6.","roles":["Hydro Buffer","On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Frozen Crown","members":["Candace","Skirk","Furina","Escoffier"],"text":"Candace buffs Skirk’s Elemental Normal Attacks and adds Hydro Resonance. Furina boosts damage; Escoffier shreds resistance and heals.","roles":["Hydro Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]}],"v":"Nilou Bloom: Build EM/ER with Flower of Paradise Lost or Gilded Dreams if Candace owns Blooms; Hydro-infused teammates own their own Blooms.\nC6 Vaporize: C6 enables extra off-field Hydro waves for Arlecchino; use high ER and Favonius Lance or an energy option.\nHyperbloom: Keep support ER/HP build with Instructor; Electro trigger (such as Kuki) needs EM, not Candace.\nC6 Damage: Use ER/HP or Hydro DMG/CRIT with Emblem if investing in her C6 Burst waves; low priority versus team buffs.\nF2P Support: Prototype Starglitter for ER, or Black Tassel if ER needs are already met; Noblesse remains reliable.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Buffer"],"about":"Candace is a Hydro support who buffs Elemental Normal Attacks and grants Hydro Infusion to Sword, Claymore, and Polearm allies. Her Burst enables creative Bloom and Normal Attack teams, while C6 adds off-field Hydro waves. Prioritize enough Energy Recharge to use her Burst reliably.","pros":["Hydro infusion utility","Normal Attack buffs","Flexible reaction teams","Accessible equipment"],"cons":["High Energy needs","Low personal damage","C6 improves Hydro uptime","Limited infusion demand"],"weapons":["Engulfing Lightning","Favonius Lance","Rightful Reward","Kitain Cross Spear","Dragon's Bane","Prototype Starglitter","Black Tassel"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"General"},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge / HP%","HP% / Hydro DMG","HP% / Crit Rate"],"stats":["Energy Recharge: 180% - 200% (2 Hydro, 2 Skills)","Energy Recharge: 230% - 260% (solo Hydro, 2 Skills)","Energy Recharge: 260% - 280% (solo Hydro, 1 Skill)","CRIT Rate: 40% - 60% (Favonius, practical target)","HP: 30,000 - 40,000+ (after ER needs)"],"vars":[{"title":"Nilou Bloom Trigger","role":"Bloom DPS","weapons":["Dragon's Bane","Kitain Cross Spear","Favonius Lance"],"arts":[{"sets":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER/EM Sands, EM Goblet, EM Circlet; level 90 is important for Blooms.","teams":"Nilou plus Dendro, with Candace actually triggering Dendro Cores.","when":"Use when Candace owns meaningful Bloom reactions, including her swap waves and C6. Other Hydro-infused teammates use their own EM.","cond":"Only Candace-owned Blooms scale with her EM.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"C6 Arlecchino Vaporize","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Engulfing Lightning","Rightful Reward"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize Burst uptime, then HP%; Favonius needs some CRIT Rate.","teams":"Arlecchino, a buffer, and an Anemo or Hydro-compatible support.","when":"C6 Hydro waves add application for Arlecchino to Vaporize in clustered fights.","cond":"Requires Candace C6.","notes":"Avoid presenting this as a reliable solo-Hydro Vaporize setup before C6.","pre":false},{"title":"Hyperbloom Infusion","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Prototype Starglitter","Black Tassel"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER first, then HP%; do not stack EM for Candace.","teams":"An on-field melee Hydro-infused attacker, Dendro applier and EM Electro trigger.","when":"Candace creates Hydro access; an Electro character triggers the Hyperblooms and needs EM.","cond":"Instructor requires Candace to trigger an on-field reaction.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"C6 Burst Damage","role":"Sub DPS","weapons":["Engulfing Lightning","Staff of Homa","Favonius Lance"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Meet ER, then HP%, Hydro DMG and CRIT; her waves scale with HP.","teams":"Another on-field character whose Elemental Normal Attacks activate C6.","when":"Only for investment-focused players seeking more personal C6 Hydro damage.","cond":"Candace C6; her own attacks cannot trigger C6.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible ER Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Prototype Starglitter","Rightful Reward","Black Tassel"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate","Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"ER Sands as needed; HP% Goblet/Circlet once Burst is consistent.","teams":"Best with a second Hydro, enough team particles, or a healer for Rightful Reward.","when":"Use obtainable weapons and mixed ER pieces while farming better support equipment.","cond":"2pc Scroll ER effect needs a Natlan teammate.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Light Guiding Tetrahedron","Teachings of Admonition","Guide to Admonition","Philosophies of Admonition","Faded Red Satin","Trimmed Red Silk","Rich Red Brocade","Henna Berry","Tears of the Calamitous God","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 8-9"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8-9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Bloom Oasis","members":["Candace","Nilou","Yaoyao","Traveler (Dendro)"]},{"name":"Hyperbloom Guard","members":["Candace","Kuki Shinobu","Nahida","Fischl"]},{"name":"Crimson Tide","members":["Candace","Arlecchino","Bennett","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Frozen Crown","members":["Candace","Skirk","Furina","Escoffier"]}]}}],"title":"Candace","el":"Hydro"}